Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.22,0:00:03.07,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The French Open finalist{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位法网决赛选手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.07,0:00:06.47,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}was nowhere near Marie Bouzkova in the opening set,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘被布兹科娃完全压制
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.60,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but she extends her stay in Wuhan{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她继续留在武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:11.75,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}with a really emphatic response.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用强有力的回应
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:14.07,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she takes it in three sets:{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她三盘拿下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:17.12,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}one-six, six-one, six-one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比分{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.57,0:00:19.64,TL,,0,0,0,,北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}14{\fs68}号上午
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.64,0:00:21.88,TL,,0,0,0,,武汉网球公开赛第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.88,0:00:25.36,TL,,0,0,0,,刚满{\fs78}25{\fs68}岁 月亮姐首盘只拿一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.54,TL,,0,0,0,,随后连赢两盘 晋级{\fs78}16{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:33.09,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}后 月亮姐连丢{\fs78}5{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.09,0:00:35.34,TL,,0,0,0,,对手用中路发球收下首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:38.41,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 月亮姐必须找回节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:52.27,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, clipping the line.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 压线了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:53.85,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Chwalinska can't believe it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡难以相信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.85,0:01:01.16,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She's finishing with a flourish{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她用漂亮的方式收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:02.82,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}with the big serve down the middle.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一记强劲的中路发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.82,0:01:04.44,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That is impressive from Marie Bouzkova.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N布兹科娃令人印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.49,0:01:05.71,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:09.09,TL,,0,0,0,,她先救下两次丢局危机 守住{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:12.94,TL,,0,0,0,,下一局 对手{\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68} 却被追到平分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.94,0:01:14.46,TL,,0,0,0,,底线被反复拉开
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:16.39,TL,,0,0,0,,月亮姐救回一拍又一拍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:19.63,TL,,0,0,0,,最后正手斜线穿越 拿到机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:49.42,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh my goodness me.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我的天！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.33,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Chwalinska is all of a sudden looking like{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡突然变得
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.33,0:01:53.90,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}a very tough nut to crack.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N难以击破
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.57,0:01:56.16,TL,,0,0,0,,第四次机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:57.52,TL,,0,0,0,,对手来到网前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:02:00.07,TL,,0,0,0,,月亮姐用一记高吊球越过头顶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.07,0:02:02.06,TL,,0,0,0,,终于拉到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.98,0:02:26.99,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that is perfectly measured from Maja Chwalinska.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡拿捏得恰到好处
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:29.21,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she converts the break points{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她兑现了破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:30.34,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}at the fourth time of asking.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是第四次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:40.60,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, that looks to be drifting.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的 看起来要飘出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:44.76,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Maja Chwalinska bouncing back off the ropes in style.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡从被动中漂亮反击
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:46.39,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Six games to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N六比一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:48.00,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Emphatically so as well.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N同样赢得十分强势
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.55,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A mirror image of the first set{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N与首盘完全反转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.55,0:02:50.99,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as she levels things up,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她扳平大比分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.65,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}taking the second by six games to one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}拿下第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:57.12,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 月亮姐先到{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:58.64,TL,,0,0,0,,对手追成{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:01.16,TL,,0,0,0,,她下一局又赢回来 最后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:04.22,TL,,0,0,0,,第一个赛点 月亮姐赢下比赛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:09.27,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Three deuce games. This is the fourth.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N之前三个平分局 这是第四个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:11.15,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But of those three, Chwalinska has won all of them.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N前三个 她全部拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:43.01,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, that is absolutely astonishing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这真是不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:44.70,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She can tie her shoelaces now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在可以系鞋带了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:47.08,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Not quite sure what happened there, but...{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N刚才发生了什么还不太确定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:49.74,TL,,0,0,0,,月亮姐随后再赢一局 {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:53.89,TL,,0,0,0,,再守到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 现在 第一个赛点！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:06.66,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, you have to say{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N可以说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:08.02,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that is an eye-catching{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这样的表现令人瞩目
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:11.10,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and a very impressive transformation from Maja Chwalinska.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赫瓦林斯卡的转变令人惊叹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:13.35,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The French Open finalist{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位法网决赛选手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.35,0:04:16.75,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}was nowhere near Marie Bouzkova in the opening set,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘被布兹科娃完全压制
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:19.88,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but she extends her stay in Wuhan{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她继续留在武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:22.03,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}with a really emphatic response.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用强有力的回应
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:24.35,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she takes it in three sets:{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她三盘拿下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:27.40,TL,,0,0,180,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}one-six, six-one, six-one.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比分{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.85,0:04:31.80,TL,,0,0,0,,全场制胜分 月亮姐{\fs78}25{\fs68} 对手{\fs78}26{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:35.56,TL,,0,0,0,,非受迫失误 月亮姐{\fs78}19{\fs68} 对手{\fs78}31{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:39.12,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘 她只有{\fs78}4{\fs68}次 对手{\fs78}16{\fs68}次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:41.79,TL,,0,0,0,,稳定 才是赢球关键
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:45.25,TL,,0,0,0,,月亮姐晋级武汉{\fs78}16{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:48.01,TL,,0,0,0,,下一轮迎战{\fs78}10{\fs68}号种子约维奇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.01,0:04:51.64,TL,,0,0,0,,连赢两盘后 她还能再进一轮吗？
